SUMMARY:Camp Life 2026
DESCRIPTION:Camp Life 2026 is back to one week!\nThis year\, Camp Life will take place at an AMAZING new camp from a Wednesday to a Tuesday. \n\nJunior Campers | Age 8-12\nTeen Campers | Age 13-17\n\nTeens that have turned 18 (and already graduated from HS this year) may apply to attend as an ‘adult’ Camper. Contact youth@ggwo.org if you would like to attend so the clearance process can be initiated.\n\n\n\nRegistration Fee- $350\n*If registering before August 1st\, a discount of $25 will automatically be applied. \nBefore you register\, please make sure you already filled out the initial Camper Application. \nClick Here to Register Now \n 
URL:https://ggwo.org/ggwo-event/camp-life-2026/
LOCATION:MD
CATEGORIES:Youth Ministry
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ggwo.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Camp-Life-2026.png
END:VEVENT
