SUMMARY:Women's Connection Study | Tuesday Mornings
DESCRIPTION:Ruth and Esther \nThis 12-week Bible study focuses on Ruth and Esther\, the only women with books named after them in the Bible. \nIn Ruth\, a widow follows her mother-in-law to Bethlehem\, marries a wealthy landowner\, and becomes King David’s great-grandmother. \nEsther\, a Jewish woman in the Persian Empire\, wins a beauty contest\, becomes queen\, and risks her life to save her people\, showcasing God’s providence. \nJoin us for weekly sessions on Tuesday mornings from September 15 – December 15 \n9:45 – 11:30A | MP3 \nNursery is included in the price and provided for those bringing children under the age of 5. \nClick Here to Register Now \n 
URL:https://ggwo.org/ggwo-event/womens-connection-study-tuesday-mornings-2/2026-09-15/
LOCATION:MD
CATEGORIES:Women
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ggwo.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Connect-Ruth-Esther-Poster.jpg
END:VEVENT
