SUMMARY:Women's Seminar | 2026
DESCRIPTION:Fri\, Sep 18 | 6-8P\n6-7:15P | Worship + Testimonies // Chapel\n7:15-8:15P | Coffee & light snacks/desserts // Patio \nSat\, Sep 19 | 9:30A-4P\n9:30-10A | Check-in // Chapel\n10A-12P | Morning Session // Chapel\n12-2P | Lunch (Separate Charge) // The Eatery\n2-4P | Afternoon Workshops // Chapel\, MBC&S Classrooms\, Cafe \nRegistration Cost | $40\nTeens | $20\nFriday Only and Saturday Only Options Available \nSaturday Lunch add-on | $21 \n-Catered by Mr. Souvlaki | Greek Salad\, Chicken Souvlaki Sticks\, Roasted Vegetables\, Pita Bread\, Tzatziki Sauce \n____________________________________________ \nBOOKS \nEphesians : | $8 \nProverbs Thirty-one | $8 \nSeminar Special | Both Books: Ephesians & Proverbs Thirty-one | $15 \n____________________________________ \nChildcare not available \n  \nClick Here to Register Now
URL:https://ggwo.org/ggwo-event/womens-seminar-2026/2026-09-18/
